%%% note
由来: https://docs.mulesoft.com/dataweave/2.11/dataweave-formats-java (言語ガイド)
doc と相違 (doc の Output と実 DW の出力の値が一致しない)
doc の Output:
  {
      "name": "Pencil",
      "quantity": "5"
  }
%%% script
%dw 2.0
output application/json
---
{
    "name": "payload.name",
    "quantity": "payload.quantity"
}
%%% output application/json
{
  "name": "payload.name",
  "quantity": "payload.quantity"
}
